lti-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (nvidia; 575.64.05) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 154.8 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nA shader like\n\n```\nshader_type spatial;\n\nstruct foo { int x; };\n\nvoid func() {\n  foo a;\n  a = true ? a : a;\n}\n```\n\nproduces the error `Error at line 7: Invalid arguments to operator '=': 'foo, '.`\n\nAccording to my understanding of GLSL, structs cannot be returned from ternary expressions. It is understandable that this fails, but the error suggests the problem is at the assignment, and the error message seems broken: it isn't clear to the user that the error is in the code, and not in Godot.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a project and put the above shader in it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-shader-ternary_2025-07-27_02-01-02.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21450723/bug-shader-ternary_2025-07-27_02-01-02.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109014/reactions","to